    ["Your garment is ready! &nbsp;And that silk you gathered was so nice... you don't mind if I made it a little short so that I'd have some silk left over for me, do you?I'm only joking. &nbsp;It'll fit you great, and will be perfect for both adventure and formal dining. &nbsp;Enjoy!"] = "¡Tu prenda está lista! &nbsp;Y esa seda que reuniste era tan bonita... no te importa que la haya dejado un poco corta para quedarme con un resto de seda, ¿verdad? Solo bromeo. &nbsp;Te quedará de maravilla, y servirá tanto para la aventura como para una cena de gala. &nbsp;¡Disfrútala!",
    ["Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. &nbsp;These gauntlets are my best work. &nbsp;Take them."] = "Gracias, <name>. &nbsp;Estas manoplas son mi mejor obra. &nbsp;Tómalas.",
