    ["I give this helm to you.Great deeds brought you to me, &lt;name&gt;, and Earthmother willing... even greater deeds lie before you."] = "Te doy este yelmo. Grandes hazañas te trajeron hasta mí, <name>, y si la Madre Tierra quiere... te esperan hazañas aún mayores.",
    ["A quest."] = "Una misión.",
    ["Always up to date."] = "Siempre al día.",
